---@field hierarchicalChunkingConfiguration? aws.qconnect.HierarchicalChunkingConfiguration Settings for hierarchical document chunking for a data source. Hierarchical chunking splits documents into layers of chunks where the first layer contains large chunks, and the second layer contains smaller chunks derived from the first layer.
